OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after fire at
OL,4,Aindustrial estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire investigation is currently under
OL,7,Fway after a fire at an industrial
OL,8,Festate in Langley Mill.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to the site in Hall Road
OL,12,Fat about 08:25 GMT on Thursday, where a
OL,13,Ffire involving an on-site caravan had
OL,14,Falso damaged nearby industrial units.
OL,16,FCrews from Alfreton, Heanor and
OL,17,FIlkeston attended the scene, along with
OL,18,Ffirefighters from Stockhill station in
OL,19,FNottinghamshire, and left at 10:36.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
